---@field highSpeedInterconnectPlacement? azure.compute.HighSpeedInterconnectPlacement Specifies the high speed interconnect placement for the virtual machine scale set.
---@field lifecycleHooksProfile? azure.compute.LifecycleHooksProfile Specifies the lifecycle hooks profile for the virtual machine scale set.
